# The stillsuit chain (dune_story_setup=stillsuit): at phase 2 with two
# troops rallied, Carthag-Tuek's chief (place names 0x205, staged at ds:4e by
# prepare_location_data_for_condit, seg000:331e) talks about the stillsuit
# maker to the east. Each tap shows his next page or line.
#
# Comments after '#' on a command line say what a click hits and what a
# wait lets finish; scripts/dune_script_trace.py prints what each line did.
wait 20000              # the story setup loads; the chief's first line shows
checkpoint stillsuit-chief-1
click left 160 80       # view: next line “Yes, I know a stillsuit maker…” (phase 2 -> 3)
wait 1200               # the line shows
checkpoint stillsuit-chief-2
click left 160 80       # view: the lesson line “On Dune, the desert covers the entire planet…”, then “My troop is settled in Carthag-Tuek…”
wait 1200               # the lines show
checkpoint stillsuit-chief-3
quit
